{
  "A value picked on a track by dragging a thumb or with the keys: one number, or a range with two thumbs. Steps, marks with labels, a value bubble, a vertical form and number formatting, with the label, help line and validation every field has.": "",
  "Range": "",
  "With `range` there are two thumbs and the value is `[start, end]`. The thumbs cannot cross; `minDistance` keeps them apart. A press on the track moves the nearer thumb.": "",
  "Centred": "",
  "With `origin` the active part of the track runs from that value to the thumb, on either side of it: a balance, an offset, a correction.": "",
  "Steps and marks": "",
  "`step` sets the values a thumb stops at. `ticks` draws a mark at every step, or with a number that many equal parts; `tickLabels` writes the values under them.": "",
  "Value bubble and format": "",
  "`showValue` puts the value in a bubble over the thumb while it is moved (`drag`, also while a key moves it) or `always`. `format` writes it with `Intl.NumberFormat`; `valueText` gives screen readers their own words.": "",
  "Vertical": "",
  "`orientation=\"vertical\"` stands the track up; up is more, and the Up arrow moves it up.": "",
  "When the value changes": "",
  "By default the value follows the thumb while it is dragged. With `updateOn=\"change\"` it changes once, when the thumb is let go — for work that should not run on every move, such as a search. The keys change it at once either way.": "",
  "Sizes, read-only, disabled, validation": "",
  "One step more. In a right-to-left page, Left is more on a horizontal slider.": "",
  "One step less.": "",
  "`largeStep` more / less.": "",
  "The least / the most; with two thumbs, as far as the other thumb lets.": "",
  "Each thumb is a Tab stop.": "",
  "Focuses the (first) thumb.": "",
  "`role=\"slider\"` with `aria-valuenow`, `aria-valuemin`, `aria-valuemax`, `aria-orientation`, and `aria-valuetext` when there is a `format` or a `valueText`.": "",
  "One thumb is named by the label. Two thumbs sit in a `role=\"group\"` named by the label; each is named by the label and its end (\"Minimum\", \"Maximum\").": "",
  "The start thumb's `aria-valuemax` is the end thumb's value, and the other way round, as the APG multi-thumb slider says.": "",
  "`aria-readonly`, `aria-invalid` and `aria-disabled` on the thumbs; the line under the track describes them.": "",
  "The pointer is captured while it drags; a press on the track moves the nearest thumb there. The track is as tall as a touch target.": "",
  "The names of the two thumbs of a range come from `uiLocale.strings` (`minimum`, `maximum`); numbers are written in `locale`, by default the page's `lang`.": "",
  "The field. `data-size`, `data-orientation`, `data-range`, `data-show-value`, `data-ticks`, `data-tick-labels`, `data-dragging`, `data-readonly`, `data-disabled`, `data-invalid`, `data-split`.": "",
  "What the pointer is pressed on: the track and the marks.": "",
  "The track, and the rail that holds its segments (`--_from`, `--_to`; `data-from=\"start | thumb | origin\"`, `data-to=\"thumb | origin | end\"`, `data-start-active`, `data-end-active`).": "",
  "The active segment, and the inactive ones before and after it (`data-side`).": "",
  "A thumb: the pressable area (`data-thumb=\"start | end\"`, `data-dragging`, `--_at`).": "",
  "What a thumb shows, centred on it: a halo, the knob and the part inside the knob.": "",
  "The value over a thumb.": "",
  "The marks (`data-mark`, `data-active`, `--_at`) and their labels.": "",
  "Units: the inactive segments (`before`, `after`), the active one (`from-start`, `to-end`) and the dots at the ends (`active`), each with its box per state (`hover`, `focus`, `pressed`, `readonly`, `disabled`).": "",
  "Units: what a thumb shows, with its box per state (`hover`, `focus`, `pressed`, `readonly`, `disabled`).": "",
  "Units: the value bubble and its arrow, the marks, their labels, and a ring around the whole control under the keys.": "",
  "The inactive and the active segments, per size.": "",
  "The knob along and across the track, and the part inside it, per size.": "",
  "A track split around the thumbs and the origin, and where the dots at its ends sit.": "",
  "How tall the track is for the pointer, and the touch target of a thumb.": "",
  "The length of a vertical slider.": "",
  "Where the marks and their labels sit.": "",
  "How far the bubble is from its thumb, and its arrow.": "",
  "The width of a horizontal slider, as for every field.": "",
  "The value; `[start, end]` with `range`. `x-model` binds it two-way. It is kept on the steps and inside the bounds.": "",
  "The caption; `&Name` makes Alt+N focus the thumb. The same property as `text`.": "",
  "The bounds. When they change the value follows and is written back.": "",
  "The values a thumb stops at, counted from `min`; `0` for any number.": "",
  "What Page Up and Page Down move by.": "",
  "Two thumbs; the value is `[start, end]`. The thumbs cannot cross.": "",
  "The least distance between the two thumbs.": "",
  "A centred slider: the active part of the track runs from this value to the thumb, on either side. Not with `range`.": "",
  "Vertical: up is more.": "",
  "`true`: a mark at every step (up to 1000); a number: that many equal parts.": "",
  "The values under the marks, or at the two ends without marks.": "",
  "A bubble with the value over the thumb: never, while it is moved (by the pointer or the keys), or always.": "",
