  "The locale of `format`.": "",
  "What screen readers say for a value. A function, so it is stored as it is, not bound.": "",
  "`change`: the value changes when the thumb is let go; the thumb still moves.": "",
  "The name it is sent with in a form; a range sends two values.": "",
  "The parts every field has; `prefix` and `suffix` sit at the two ends of the track.": "",
  "Can be focused and read, not moved.": "",
  "`sm`, `md`, `lg`: the rail and the thumbs.": "",
